                            "note":  "Fable 5.1, fired LAST as a subagent pinned to model fable; opened by naming itself claude-fable-5-1 (verified).  D1: clause (e), both cells, rows L1 -- and the rule the next pure deletion inherits.  Codex\u0027s three gaps: coverage debt; the repair chain CLOSES on this pass (zero floor breaches, with the denominator).  F15 was a WRONG RECORD: narrowing tmp to uint32_t made the `sh ?` guard load-bearing for definedness.  xscale ready behind a green gate; PPC ready after gate restore + pin check, the F15 record, the F11 caveat, and scoping ppc_rldicl_probe.py by name."
